+Calculates source triangle index `ix_src_triangle = gl_GlobalInvocationID.x` and returns if `ix_src_triangle >= n_triangles` [S2, unofficial]. Computes vertex indices `index_offset = first_index + 3 * ix_src_triangle`, retrieves `i0, i1, i2` from the `indices` buffer offset by `first_vertex`, and gets world positions `p0_model, p1_model, p2_model` from the `vertices` buffer [S2, unofficial]. Transforms vertices to cascade local space: `p = (model_matrix * vec4(p_model, 1.0)).xyz - anchors[target_cascade].xyz` [S2, unofficial]. Uses UBO `BinningAUBO` containing `mat4 model_matrix`, `vec4 diffuse`, `vec4 emissive`, `uint target_cascade`, `uint bin_group_offset`, `uint buffer_group_index`, `uint buffer_group_offset`, `uint n_triangles`, `uint first_index`, `uint first_vertex` [S2, unofficial]. Buffer layout includes `uint n_buffered_triangles[2]` and `Triangle buf[]`, where `Triangle` layout matches the voxelization format [S2, unofficial].
